Pour the @Crème de Cassis{1%ounce} into a #champagne glass{}.

Slowly pour in the @Champagne{6%ounces} (or Prosecco, chilled) to fill the glass. You may want to adjust the ratio of Cassis to Champagne to suit your tastes. 

Enjoy!
